T1  - Effects of a Home-Based and Volunteer-Administered Physical Training, Nutritional, and Social Support Program on Malnutrition and Frailty in Older Persons: A Randomized Controlled Trial
AU  - Luger, Eva
AU  - Dorner, Thomas Ernst
AU  - Haider, Sandra
AU  - Kapan, Ali
AU  - Lackinger, Christian
AU  - Schindler, Karin
JO  - Journal of the American Medical Directors Association
VL  - 17
