T1  - What are the Emotional Experiences of Being a Volunteer in Palliative and End-of-Life Care Settings? A Systematic Review and Thematic Synthesis
AU  - Coleman, Helena
AU  - Walshe, Catherine
JO  - Journal of Pain and Symptom Management
VL  - 62
